    "physical_definition": "Change only shared westerly_speed to exactly5.0/6.25/7.5m/s, within existing2\u201312m/s calibration bounds; prior value8.760247102945932. This is the background latitude-belt peak amplitude, with fixed poleward component0.15u and existing seasonal factor1-0.25s, before terrain drag, pressure flow and1km moisture thermal shear. Temperature/sea state/pressure and actual moisture profile may respond through coupled physics, but no other physical coefficient or planetary setting changes. Corrected column-convection and precipitation recycling, common dry mass, independent no-mixing layer water, calibrated capacities/boundaries/land/ocean source laws/drying/storms stay fixed. No imposed observed wind, humidity reset, local parameter or latent-energy claim.",
    "control": "42 actual coupled regional runs:7original r39 exact monthly climate/native-wind controls;7historical common-mass controls;7corrected no-mix controls; then21candidate runs. All21controls before candidates. Old NPZ fieldsets and all arrays exact; extra PNW circulation is JSON-only. Reference PNW geographic native wind also must match independent audit exactly. Preserve failures and no additional amplitude after outcomes.",
    "screen": "All strict numerical/conservative-vapor/storm checks and scaled column-mass residual<=1e-10 required. Same accuracy guards: S<=.995, mean rain ratio<=.99,T ratio<=1.01; NI rain ratio<=.95; Iran<=1.02; every other region S<=1.02. Actual integrated SST MAE increase<=.02C on identical observation-only masks, column speed max<=60m/s,p95<=25m/s. Fixed outside-wind guards: NI native partial-column vector RMSE improvement>=5%; Iberia ocean/EastAustralia lowland worsening<=2%, identical masks and areas. No additional candidate, weakened threshold or new validation sampling after outcomes. Also require two_layer_transport certificate with dry-column residual<=1e-10 and EACH branch wind maximum<=60m/s,p95<=25m/s (all primer/scored steps), rather than hiding a fast return in the weighted mean. Exactly2 fixed reservoir closures, with strict layer/column certificates throughout. Additionally predeclare Iberia ocean native monthly partial humidity protection against the rerun fixed-profile transport control: PW925-300 MAE and upper700-300/lower925-700 mean specific-humidity ratio MAE may each worsen at most2%, with identical native cells/areas. Observed anchor is not assimilated; use actual solved model water and model piecewise-uniform layer q integrated over exactly matched pressures. Exclude any footprint containing model below-ground925hPa. Full-column humidity ratio is not compared directly with partial observations. No new error limit or candidate after outcomes. Corrected scheme must be certified at every primer/scored step and at every later gate; same unchanged numerical and physical accuracy protections. Require conservative precipitation re-evaporation transfer certificate and absolute internal cancellation<=1e-10mm/day throughout. Additionally require PNW ocean native q925\u2013300 vector RMSE reduction>=10% versus fresh corrected column_control on identical cells/areas, and partialPW plus partial vertical-shape MAEs each worsen at most2% versus that same control. These are reused4ocean development footprints, not land/global validation. Every pre-existing7region, native-wind, Iberia humidity, ocean and layer/mass guard remains. Exactly3predeclared amplitudes.",
    "advance": "This first-stage calibration writes maximum_finalists=0 to prevent automatic adoption before the new circulation safeguard is carried through later gates. If any eligible candidate passes every screening guard, continue with a separately frozen at-most2candidate full31/ocean/fine/established comparison under all unchanged original guards, repeatingPNW native circulation and humidity at56/28km. No thresholds may be weakened. Fantasy/world qualification remains separate. A screening qualifier alone is not an adopted fit.",
    "publication": "42fixed actual Earth integrations,21historical controls then21candidates. Publish every score/failure and fixed middle-amplitude map. No normal climate/headline release from screening. All reanalysis is diagnostic and never forcing. Supervisor source-change stop and2h ceiling.",
